<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xml:lang="ja" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Monster"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="YOASOBI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Monster - Single"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1544083979"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>Ayase</songwriter></songwriters><translations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">且向这看似美妙的世界再次举杯</text><text for="L2">街巷中交织回荡的欢声笑语</text><text for="L3">也不过是装作视而不见的虚妄造作</text><text for="L4">压抑得几欲令人发狂</text><text for="L5">浓烈至令人眩晕的诱人香气</text><text for="L6">直直刺痛了鼻息深处</text><text for="L7">任由骤然苏醒的野性本能驱使</text><text for="L8">今天又该轮到了谁</text><text for="L9">在这颠倒的世界里究竟能做些什么</text><text for="L10">渺小如我又究竟能有何作为</text><text for="L11">唯愿你那一双澄黑明澈的眼眸</text><text for="L12">永不再有泪水决堤滑落</text><text for="L13">对着心之所向的未来无论多少次</text><text for="L14">亦要死死咬紧绝不松口</text><text for="L15">在这错谬丛生的世间之中</text><text for="L16">只愿能守护你由衷的笑靥</text><text for="L17">决不再去伤害任何生灵</text><text for="L18">我是多么渴望变得无比强大</text><text for="L19">好让我始终守住真实的自我</text><text for="L20">这看似美好的世界今日依然安享太平</text><text for="L21">街头巷尾暗流涌动的凶险传闻</text><text for="L22">也都佯装一概不知避开了目光</text><text for="L23">委实是丧失理智的疯癫</text><text for="L24">衣冠楚楚道貌岸然的行进队伍</text><text for="L25">踏着轻快足音奔赴的归宿</text><text for="L26">却浸染着久久难散挥之不去的血腥滋味</text><text for="L27">那座隐匿于阴暗处的背面世界</text><text for="L28">恪守清白正直地生存于世</text><text for="L29">不令任何生灵蒙受悲痛地活着</text><text for="L30">循规蹈矩不偏不倚地前行</text><text for="L31">难道这就是毫无过错的人生吗</text><text for="L32">顺从与生俱来的天性而活便是正义吗</text><text for="L33">自欺欺人苟且偷生就算是正义吗</text><text for="L34">究竟怎样才是我应有的模样</text><text for="L35">真实的我到底又是何等存在</text><text for="L36">谁来给我一个解答</text><text for="L37">究竟谁能指明我的前路</text><text for="L38">时至今日</text><text for="L39">在这寻觅不到答案的世界里</text><text for="L40">我仍在心底深处默默祈愿</text><text for="L41">纵使我是这般笨拙木讷</text><text for="L42">亦愿能与你长久相伴相依</text><text for="L43">永远并肩绽放纯粹的笑颜</text><text for="L44">胸腔中剧烈跳动的心脏</text><text for="L45">撼动着整副躯体竭力呐喊</text><text for="L46">就在此刻奋然启程挺身而出</text><text for="L47">将那软弱怯懦的自己千百次地</text><text for="L48">彻底撕扯吞噬殆尽</text><text for="L49">置身这颠倒错乱的荒诞世间</text><text for="L50">唯盼能望见你释然的笑颜</text><text for="L51">为了不再让任何生灵泪流满面</text><text for="L52">我发自心底渴望变得无坚不摧</text><text for="L53">好让我历尽风霜仍不改本心</text><text for="L54">哪怕仅仅是为了将你庇护周全</text><text for="L55">我也要拼尽全力狂奔疾驰</text><text for="L56">彻底超越蛰伏在我心中的那头怪物</text></translation></translations><transliterations xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><transliteration xml:lang="ja-Latn" xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata"><text for="L1"><span begin="0:01.852" end="0:02.735">su ba ra shi ki </span><span begin="0:02.735" end="0:03.437">se kai ni </span><span begin="0:03.437" end="0:04.020">kyou mo </span><span begin="0:04.020" end="0:04.636">kan pai</span></text><text for="L2"><span begin="0:04.645" end="0:05.361">machi ni </span><span begin="0:05.361" end="0:06.097">to bi ka u </span><span begin="0:06.097" end="0:06.760">wara i</span><span begin="0:06.760" end="0:07.357">goe mo</span></text><text for="L3"><span begin="0:07.365" end="0:08.042">mite minu </span><span begin="0:08.042" end="0:09.427">furi shi te ru dake no </span><span begin="0:09.427" end="0:09.915">tsuku</span><span begin="0:09.915" end="0:10.419">ri</span><span begin="0:10.419" end="0:10.680">mon </span><span begin="0:10.680" end="0:11.069">sa</span></text><text for="L4"><span begin="0:11.678" end="0:12.094">ki ga </span><span begin="0:12.094" end="0:12.487">fure </span><span begin="0:12.487" end="0:13.109">souda</span></text><text for="L5"><span begin="0:13.140" end="0:13.822">ku ra ku ra</span><span begin="0:13.822" end="0:14.192">suru</span><span begin="0:14.192" end="0:14.692">hodo no</span><span begin="0:14.692" end="0:15.109">ii</span><span begin="0:15.109" end="0:15.563">nioi</span><span begin="0:15.563" end="0:15.846">ga</span></text><text for="L6"><span begin="0:15.853" end="0:16.218">tsun </span><span begin="0:16.218" end="0:16.474">to </span><span begin="0:16.474" end="0:17.071">sa shi ta </span><span begin="0:17.071" end="0:17.579">hana no </span><span begin="0:17.579" end="0:18.043">oku</span></text><text for="L7"><span begin="0:18.073" end="0:18.449">me o </span><span begin="0:18.449" end="0:18.991">sa ma su </span><span begin="0:18.991" end="0:19.844">hon nou no </span><span begin="0:19.844" end="0:20.176">mama</span></text><text for="L8"><span begin="0:20.186" end="0:20.752">kyou wa </span><span begin="0:20.752" end="0:21.215">dare </span><span begin="0:21.215" end="0:21.471">no </span><span begin="0:21.471" end="0:22.322">ban da？</span></text><text for="L9"><span begin="0:22.889" end="0:23.430">ko no </span><span begin="0:23.430" end="0:24.600">se kai </span><span begin="0:24.600" end="0:25.056">de </span><span begin="0:25.212" end="0:25.862">nani ga </span><span begin="0:25.862" end="0:26.366">de ki ru </span><span begin="0:26.366" end="0:26.843">no ka</span></text><text for="L10"><span begin="0:26.873" end="0:27.684">boku ni wa </span><span begin="0:27.684" end="0:28.296">nani </span><span begin="0:28.296" end="0:28.616">ga </span><span begin="0:28.669" end="0:29.159">de ki ru </span><span begin="0:29.159" end="0:29.641">no ka</span></text><text for="L11"><span begin="0:29.670" end="0:30.104">tada </span><span begin="0:30.104" end="0:30.686">so no </span><span begin="0:30.686" end="0:31.779">mak kuro na </span><span begin="0:31.779" end="0:32.494">me kara</span></text><text for="L12"><span begin="0:32.522" end="0:33.071">namida</span><span begin="0:33.071" end="0:33.999">kobo re</span><span begin="0:33.999" end="0:34.724">ochi</span><span begin="0:34.724" end="0:35.195">nai you</span><span begin="0:35.195" end="0:35.600">ni</span></text><text for="L13"><span begin="0:35.912" end="0:36.370">nega u </span><span begin="0:36.370" end="0:37.196">mi rai ni </span><span begin="0:37.196" end="0:38.069">nan do demo </span><span begin="0:38.069" end="0:38.644">zut to</span></text><text for="L14"><span begin="0:38.652" end="0:39.212">kurai</span><span begin="0:39.212" end="0:39.668">tsuku</span></text><text for="L15"><span begin="0:39.678" end="0:40.306">ko no </span><span begin="0:40.306" end="0:41.059">ma chiga i </span><span begin="0:41.059" end="0:41.872">da ra ke no </span><span begin="0:41.872" end="0:43.320">se kai no </span><span begin="0:43.320" end="0:43.898">naka</span></text><text for="L16"><span begin="0:43.908" end="0:45.352">kimi ni wa </span><span begin="0:45.352" end="0:46.173">warat te </span><span begin="0:46.173" end="0:46.698">ho shi i </span><span begin="0:46.698" end="0:47.096">kara</span></text><text for="L17"><span begin="0:47.105" end="0:47.828">mou </span><span begin="0:47.828" end="0:48.418">dare mo </span><span begin="0:48.418" end="0:49.081">kizu tsu ke</span><span begin="0:49.081" end="0:49.437">nai</span></text><text for="L18"><span begin="0:49.448" end="0:50.198">tsuyo ku </span><span begin="0:50.198" end="0:50.945">tsuyo ku </span><span begin="0:50.945" end="0:51.663">na ri tai n</span><span begin="0:51.663" end="0:52.096">da yo</span></text><text for="L19"><span begin="0:52.107" end="0:52.702">boku ga </span><span begin="0:52.702" end="0:53.571">boku de </span><span begin="0:53.571" end="0:54.904">i ra re ru </span><span begin="0:54.904" end="0:55.703">you ni</span></text><text for="L20"><span begin="1:03.892" end="1:04.830">su ba ra shi ki </span><span begin="1:04.830" end="1:05.552">se kai wa </span><span begin="1:05.552" end="1:06.159">kyou mo </span><span begin="1:06.159" end="1:06.732">an tai</span></text><text for="L21"><span begin="1:06.741" end="1:07.535">machi ni </span><span begin="1:07.535" end="1:08.249">uzu ma ku </span><span begin="1:08.249" end="1:08.873">warui </span><span begin="1:08.873" end="1:09.743">hanashi mo</span></text><text for="L22"><span begin="1:09.753" end="1:10.450">shi ra nai </span><span begin="1:10.450" end="1:11.144">shi ra nai </span><span begin="1:11.144" end="1:11.911">furi shite </span><span begin="1:11.911" end="1:12.243">me o </span><span begin="1:12.243" end="1:13.013">so ra shi ta</span></text><text for="L23"><span begin="1:13.711" end="1:14.554">shou ki no </span><span begin="1:14.554" end="1:14.868">sa ta </span><span begin="1:14.868" end="1:15.277">ja na</span><span begin="1:15.277" end="1:15.755">i na</span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="1:15.764" end="1:16.489">ma ji me ni </span><span begin="1:16.489" end="1:17.409">ki ka zat ta </span><span begin="1:17.409" end="1:18.041">kou shin</span></text><text for="L25"><span begin="1:18.051" end="1:18.609">na ra su </span><span begin="1:18.609" end="1:19.529">ashi oto ga </span><span begin="1:19.529" end="1:20.229">hazu mu </span><span begin="1:20.229" end="1:20.501">iki</span><span begin="1:20.501" end="1:21.102">saki wa</span></text><text for="L26"><span begin="1:21.112" end="1:21.792">ki e nai </span><span begin="1:21.792" end="1:22.413">ki e nai </span><span begin="1:22.413" end="1:23.052">aji ga </span><span begin="1:23.052" end="1:23.431">shimi </span><span begin="1:23.431" end="1:24.357">tsu i te iru</span></text><text for="L27"><span begin="1:25.068" end="1:26.002">ura ga wa no </span><span begin="1:26.002" end="1:26.756">se kai</span></text><text for="L28"><span begin="1:37.938" end="1:38.591">kiyo ku </span><span begin="1:38.591" end="1:39.274">tada shi ku </span><span begin="1:39.274" end="1:39.775">i ki ru </span><span begin="1:39.775" end="1:40.246">koto</span></text><text for="L29"><span begin="1:40.277" end="1:40.864">dare mo </span><span begin="1:40.864" end="1:42.072">kana shi ma se zu ni </span><span begin="1:42.072" end="1:42.595">i ki ru </span><span begin="1:42.595" end="1:43.013">koto</span></text><text for="L30"><span begin="1:43.044" end="1:43.498">hami</span><span begin="1:43.498" end="1:44.044">da sa zu </span><span begin="1:44.044" end="1:44.896">mas sugu ni </span><span begin="1:44.896" end="1:45.386">i ki ru </span><span begin="1:45.386" end="1:45.819">koto</span></text><text for="L31"><span begin="1:45.848" end="1:46.444">so re ga </span><span begin="1:46.444" end="1:47.710">ma chiga wa nai de </span><span begin="1:47.710" end="1:48.261">i ki ru </span><span begin="1:48.261" end="1:48.664">koto？</span></text><text for="L32"><span begin="1:48.693" end="1:49.666">a ri no ma ma </span><span begin="1:49.666" end="1:50.739">i ki ru koto ga </span><span begin="1:50.739" end="1:51.477">sei gi ka</span></text><text for="L33"><span begin="1:51.508" end="1:52.119">dama shi </span><span begin="1:52.119" end="1:52.711">dama shi </span><span begin="1:52.711" end="1:53.501">i ki ru no wa </span><span begin="1:53.501" end="1:54.352">sei gi ka</span></text><text for="L34"><span begin="1:54.381" end="1:54.976">boku no </span><span begin="1:54.976" end="1:55.674">a ru be ki </span><span begin="1:55.674" end="1:56.583">sugata to wa </span><span begin="1:56.583" end="1:57.137">nanda</span></text><text for="L35"><span begin="1:57.167" end="1:57.978">hon tou no </span><span begin="1:57.978" end="1:58.486">boku wa </span><span begin="1:58.486" end="1:59.199">nani mono </span><span begin="1:59.199" end="1:59.713">nanda</span></text><text for="L36"><span begin="1:59.723" end="2:00.426">oshi e te </span><span begin="2:00.426" end="2:01.243">kure yo</span></text><text for="L37"><span begin="2:05.281" end="2:06.057">oshi e te </span><span begin="2:06.057" end="2:06.861">kure yo</span></text><text for="L38"><span begin="2:11.124" end="2:11.505">kyou </span><span begin="2:11.505" end="2:11.818">mo</span></text><text for="L39"><span begin="2:11.828" end="2:12.408">kotae </span><span begin="2:12.408" end="2:12.983">no nai </span>